 make it easier to discover reliable AI tools, keep a personal shortlist, and stay current with meaningful additions.</p><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What kinds of AI tools are listed?</h2><p class="mb-3">The directory currently covers <strong>8 categories</strong> including writing, image generation, video/audio creation, coding assistants, research, productivity, design, and marketing.</p><p class="mb-6">Tools are grouped by category and updated regularly. You can mark favorites, hide listings, and use random discovery to explore new products.</p><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Live Database Stats</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-8"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-3 md:p-4 border border-colorTextSofter bg-colorCardC text-center min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><span class="font-bold text-xs sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl">128</span><span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-colorTextSoft mt-1">Tools Listed</span></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-3 md:p-4 border border-colorTextSofter bg-colorCardC text-center min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><span class="font-bold text-xs sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl">+5</span><span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-colorTextSoft mt-1">Last 30 Days<div class="google-anno-skip google-anno-sc" tabindex="0" role="link" aria-label="Photo Software" data-google-vignette="false" data-google-interstitial="false" style="color-scheme: initial !important; forced-color-adjust: initial !important; math-depth: initial !important; position: initial !important; position-anchor: initial !important; text-size-adjust: initial !important; appearance: initial !important; font-feature-settings: initial !important; font-kerning: initial !important; font-language-override: initial !important; font-optical-sizing: initial !important; font-palette: initial !important; font-size-adjust: initial !important; font-stretch: initial !important; font-style: initial !important; font-synthesis: